    "The immutable registry is admitted from complete module literal declarations before callbacks; no schema/member learning from constructors, values or checkpoints.",
    "Exact source-qualified declaration IDs, ordered enum names/titles, UDT types/varip flags and complete forward/cyclic closure are validated; serialized data cannot mutate frozen registry records/indexes.",
